                    US. Secret. Drafted by Dexter and approved by Moore and Okun on March 12. The meeting was held
                    in the Secretary’s office. The memorandum is part 2 of 4; regarding parts 1, 3,
                    and 4, see <ref target="#d48-f1">footnote 1, Document 48</ref>.</p>
